B.a06=new A.hj("CRIMZONE","crimzone","Not everything in the red zone is worth the same. Distance has a price.","Rare")
B.a09=new A.hj("WMIAN","wmian","Don't forrow your eyebrows. They're all coming to you now, big and small alike.","Legendary")
B.a03=new A.hj("QUIT","quit","You don't get to hear this one until you've already proven your worth. It's a one-time deal, so make it count.","Mythic")
